OL,3,GNEWSA'There was no warning sign' -     
OL,4,Acalls for more education to reduce     
OL,5,Asuicide in men and boys                
OL,7,FA father whose son died by suicide on  
OL,8,Fthe day after his 22nd birthday has    
OL,9,Fcalled for more education on how men   
OL,10,Fand boys can seek help during a mental 
OL,11,Fhealth crisis.                         
OL,13,FSeamus Waites said there was "no       
OL,14,Fwarning sign whatsoever" before his son
OL,15,FThomas took his own life in May 2016,  
OL,16,Fjust hours after he went out to        
OL,17,Fcelebrate with friends.                
