OL,3,GNEWSA'There was no warning sign' -     
OL,4,Acalls for more education to reduce     
OL,5,Asuicide in men and boys                
OL,7,FWaites, who has since become a grief   
OL,8,Fcounsellor, said when men reach crisis 
OL,9,Fpoint they "do not understand the      
OL,10,Femotions that they're feeling, they    
OL,11,Fbecome totally overwhelmed and don't   
OL,12,Fknow where to go".                     
OL,14,FSuicide remains the leading cause of   
OL,15,Fdeath for boys and men aged under 50 in
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland - of the 262 people   
OL,17,Fwho took their own lives last year, 203
OL,18,Fwere male.                             
